<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Terraform provider {{.Provider}}: generation report</title>
<style>
:root{--fg:#1a1a1a;--dim:#5c5c5c;--bg:#fff;--panel:#f6f6f4;--rule:#e0ddd8;--lost:#8a3324;--ok:#2f5d3a;--accent:#31527a}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root{--fg:#e8e6e3;--dim:#a09c96;--bg:#16171a;--panel:#1e2024;--rule:#33363c;--lost:#e8927c;--ok:#8fc7a1;--accent:#8fb3e0}}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;padding:2.5rem 1.25rem 6rem;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);
 font:15.5px/1.65 ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif}
main{max-width:62rem;margin:0 auto}
h1{font-size:1.7rem;margin:0 0 .5rem;font-weight:660;letter-spacing:-.01em}
h2{font-size:1.15rem;margin:3rem 0 .5rem;font-weight:660;letter-spacing:-.005em}
h2:first-of-type{margin-top:2rem}
p{margin:.6rem 0}
.lede{font-size:1.05rem;max-width:46rem}
.note{color:var(--dim);max-width:46rem}
code,.mono{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:.85em}
dl.facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:max-content 1fr;gap:.45rem 1.5rem;margin:1rem 0 0;
 background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:10px;padding:1.1rem 1.35rem}
dl.facts dt{color:var(--dim)}
dl.facts dd{margin:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
ol.workflow{max-width:46rem;padding-left:1.3rem;margin:.8rem 0 0}
ol.workflow li{margin:.45rem 0}
ol.workflow b{font-weight:640}
ol.workflow span{color:var(--dim)}
ul.counts{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;padding:0;margin:1rem 0 .5rem}
ul.counts li{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:7px;padding:.4rem .8rem}
ul.counts b{font-weight:660;font-size:1.05em}
details{border:1px solid var(--rule);border-radius:9px;margin:.5rem 0;background:var(--panel)}
details>summary{cursor:pointer;padding:.65rem .95rem;font-weight:620;list-style:none;display:flex;
 gap:.6rem;align-items:baseline;flex-wrap:wrap}
details>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
details>summary::before{content:"▸";color:var(--dim);font-weight:400}
details[open]>summary::before{content:"▾"}
details .body{padding:.2rem .95rem 1rem 2rem}
details details{background:var(--bg);margin:.6rem 0}
details details>summary{font-weight:500;font-size:.9em;color:var(--dim);padding:.4rem .7rem}
.tally{color:var(--dim);font-weight:420;font-size:.92em}
.lost{color:var(--lost)}
.ok{color:var(--ok)}
.finding{border-left:3px solid var(--rule);padding:.15rem 0 .15rem .9rem;margin:1.1rem 0}
.finding h4{margin:0 0 .2rem;font-size:1rem;font-weight:640}
.finding p{margin:.25rem 0}
.finding .cost{font-size:.93em}
.finding .fix{color:var(--dim);font-size:.93em}
table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:.92em}
th,td{text-align:left;padding:.38rem .6rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);vertical-align:top}
th{color:var(--dim);font-weight:620}
td.num{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}
p.none{color:var(--dim);font-style:italic}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>

<h1>Terraform provider: {{.Provider}}</h1>
<p class="lede">This Terraform provider was generated from the OpenAPI{{if .Document.OpenAPI}} {{.Document.OpenAPI}}{{end}} specification for the {{.Provider}} API{{if .Document.Version}}, version {{.Document.Version}}{{end}}. Every file in this repository was produced from that specification. None of it was written by hand.</p>
<p class="lede">The provider does not call the API directly. It calls a Go client library, generated from the same specification by {{.SDK.Backend}} {{.SDK.Version}}.</p>
<p class="lede">This report explains how the provider was generated: the steps taken, the decisions made at each step, and what each decision means for the provider you now have.</p>

<h2>What this provider was built from</h2>
<dl class="facts">
  <dt>OpenAPI specification</dt><dd class="mono">{{.Document.Source}}</dd>
  <dt>Specification version</dt><dd>{{.Document.Version}}{{if .Document.OpenAPI}}, written to OpenAPI {{.Document.OpenAPI}}{{end}}</dd>
  <dt>SHA-256 checksum</dt><dd class="mono">{{.Document.SHA256}}</dd>
  <dd class="note" style="grid-column:2">The exact bytes this provider was built from. A different version of the specification will produce a different provider, and this checksum is how you tell which one you have.</dd>
  <dt>Corrections applied</dt><dd>{{.Document.Corrections}}</dd>
  <dd class="note" style="grid-column:2">Recorded changes made to the specification before generating, each with a reason. Usually something the live API does that the specification does not say.</dd>
  <dt>API client generator</dt><dd>{{.SDK.Backend}} {{.SDK.Version}}</dd>
</dl>

<h2>How it was generated</h2>
<p class="note">Each step below can set something aside. Where that happened, this report says which step, what it cost, and whether anything can be done about it.</p>
<ol class="workflow">
{{range .Workflow}}<li><b>{{.Name}}.</b> <span>{{.Detail}}</span></li>
{{end}}</ol>

<h2>What was produced</h2>
<ul class="counts">
  <li><b>{{.Produced.Resources}}</b> resources</li>
  <li><b>{{.Produced.Datasources}}</b> data sources</li>
  <li><b>{{.Produced.ListResources}}</b> list resources</li>
  <li><b>{{.Produced.Actions}}</b> actions</li>
  <li class="lost"><b>{{.Produced.Refused}}</b> set aside</li>
</ul>
<p class="note">{{if .Produced.Kept}}{{.Produced.Kept}} attributes are in the schema with nothing behind them in the generated client; they are how Terraform identifies and imports an object, so they were kept rather than dropped. {{end}}{{if .SDK.Reconciled}}In {{.SDK.Reconciled}} places the generated client named something differently from what was expected, and the generated code was matched to what the client actually has. That is routine, and it is the scale the findings below should be read against.{{end}}</p>

{{if .Rewrites}}
<h2>Changes made to the specification before the API client was generated</h2>
<p class="note">A few things an OpenAPI specification can express, {{.SDK.Backend}} cannot. It was given an adjusted copy rather than the specification itself. The specification committed in this repository is unchanged, and the adjusted copy is discarded once the API client is built, so the list below is the only record of how the two differed. Each entry says why the change was necessary and what it cost.</p>
{{range .Rewrites}}
<details>
  <summary>{{.Name}} <span class="tally">{{.Count}} in {{len .Sites}} {{if eq (len .Sites) 1}}place{{else}}places{{end}}</span></summary>
  <div class="body">
    <p>{{.Why}}</p>
    <p class="fix"><b>What this cost you:</b> {{.Cost}}</p>
    {{if .Sites}}
    <details>
      <summary>Where in the specification ({{len .Sites}} {{if eq (len .Sites) 1}}place{{else}}places{{end}})</summary>
      <div class="body">
        <table><thead><tr><th>Schema or path</th><th class="num">Changes</th></tr></thead><tbody>
        {{range .Sites}}<tr><td class="mono">{{.Where}}</td><td class="num">{{.Count}}</td></tr>{{end}}
        </tbody></table>
      </div>
    </details>
    {{else}}<p class="none">Nothing was changed.</p>{{end}}
  </div>
</details>
{{end}}
{{end}}

<h2>What became of each part of the API</h2>
<p class="note">Grouped the way the OpenAPI specification groups itself, by its own tags. Each thing shows what it became and, where something was set aside, one entry per reason with everything that reason cost.</p>
{{range .Tags}}
<details>
  <summary>{{.Name}}
    <span class="tally">{{len .Entities}} {{if eq (len .Entities) 1}}item{{else}}items{{end}}{{if .Refused}} · <span class="lost">{{.Refused}} produced nothing</span>{{end}}{{if .Lost}} · <span class="lost">{{.Lost}} {{if eq .Lost 1}}attribute{{else}}attributes{{end}} set aside</span>{{end}}</span>
  </summary>
  <div class="body">
  {{range .Entities}}
    <details>
      <summary><span class="mono">{{.Key}}</span>
        <span class="tally">{{if .Produced}}generated as {{join .Produced}}{{else}}<span class="lost">produced nothing</span>{{end}}{{if .Causes}} · {{len .Causes}} {{if eq (len .Causes) 1}}finding{{else}}findings{{end}}{{end}}</span>
      </summary>
      <div class="body">
        {{if .CollectionPath}}<p class="note mono">{{.CollectionPath}}</p>{{end}}
        {{if .Whole}}<p class="none">Everything the specification offers for this was generated.</p>{{end}}
        {{range .Causes}}
        <div class="finding">
          <h4>{{.Title}}</h4>
          <p>{{.Means}}</p>
          {{if .Attributes}}<p class="cost"><b>{{len .Attributes}} {{if eq (len .Attributes) 1}}attribute{{else}}attributes{{end}}:</b> <span class="mono">{{join .Attributes}}</span></p>{{end}}
          <p class="fix"><b>Can this be changed?</b> {{.Fix}}</p>
          <details>
            <summary>Technical detail</summary>
            <div class="body">
              <table><tbody>
                <tr><th>Identifier</th><td class="mono">{{.Code}}</td></tr>
                <tr><th>Step</th><td>{{if .Step}}Step {{.Step}}, {{end}}{{.Where}}</td></tr>
                {{if .Subject}}<tr><th>Subject</th><td class="mono">{{.Subject}}</td></tr>{{end}}
                <tr><th>Verbatim</th><td class="mono">{{.Reason}}</td></tr>
              </tbody></table>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
        {{end}}
      </div>
    </details>
  {{end}}
  </div>
</details>
{{else}}<p class="none">The specification yielded nothing Terraform can manage.</p>{{end}}

{{if .Unplaced}}
<h2>Set aside before they belonged anywhere</h2>
<p class="note">These were set aside before it was decided what part of the API they belong to, so they are listed on their own.</p>
{{range .Unplaced}}
<div class="finding">
  <h4>{{.Title}} <span class="tally mono">{{.Entity}}</span></h4>
  <p>{{.Means}}</p>
  <p class="fix"><b>Can this be changed?</b> {{.Fix}}</p>
  <details>
    <summary>Technical detail</summary>
    <div class="body">
      <table><tbody>
        <tr><th>Identifier</th><td class="mono">{{.Code}}</td></tr>
        <tr><th>Step</th><td>{{if .Step}}Step {{.Step}}, {{end}}{{.Where}}</td></tr>
        {{if .Subject}}<tr><th>Subject</th><td class="mono">{{.Subject}}</td></tr>{{end}}
        <tr><th>Verbatim</th><td class="mono">{{.Reason}}</td></tr>
      </tbody></table>
    </div>
  </details>
</div>
{{end}}
{{end}}

</main>
</body>
</html>
